OL,3,AWhat Democrats can and can't do with
OL,4,Atheir new power after taking Congress
OL,5,
OL,6,FElection night was a fever dream for
OL,7,FDemocrats. In January, reality will set
OL,8,Fin.
OL,10,FThey had a reason to be giddy on
OL,11,FTuesday night: Next year, Democrats
OL,12,Fwill take control of both chambers of
OL,13,FCongress after a blowout victory.
OL,15,F"Today begins the great American
OL,16,Fcomeback," an ecstatic Hakeem Jeffries,
OL,17,FHouse Democratic leader, declared.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
