OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJoshua Wong, face of Hong Kong's
OL,4,Apro-democracy protests, jailed for 10
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FCritics say the far-reaching law has
OL,8,Fsilenced dissent, but authorities argue
OL,9,Fthat it is needed to maintain stability
OL,10,Fand deny it has weakened the city's
OL,11,Fcherished autonomy.
OL,13,FHaving already spent the last six years
OL,14,Fin jail, Wong, who was due to be freed
OL,15,Fin January, will now spend another
OL,16,Fdecade behind bars.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
